%% /run-issues Phase 2 — PR watcher state machine (P1..P9)
%% pr-watch.sh <repo-root> <pr-number|scan>. Idempotent polling, no resume.
%% Decision logic lives in lib/pr-watch-lib.sh (pr_decide).
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> P1_Discover

    P1_Discover: P1 Discover\nnamed PR or scan completed runs\n(host match, pr_url non-null)
    P1_Discover --> P2_Lock: candidate found
    P1_Discover --> SCAN_EMPTY: scan, no candidate

    P2_Lock: P2 Lock\nlock_issue(issue) — shared per-issue lock
    P2_Lock --> P3_Classify: lock acquired
    P2_Lock --> LOCK_RACE: lock held elsewhere

    P3_Classify: P3 Classify\ngh pr view (state, mergeable,\nmergeStateStatus, labels, rollup)
    P3_Classify --> P4_Decide: classified
    P3_Classify --> NOT_MERGEABLE: gh pr view failed

    P4_Decide: P4 Decide\npr_decide()
    P4_Decide --> P5c_Gate: MERGE
    P4_Decide --> P5_Resolve: REBASE (conflict-res ON)
    P4_Decide --> P5b_FixCI: FIX_CI (ci-repair ON)
    P4_Decide --> NOT_MERGEABLE: SKIP_* / WAIT_*

    P5_Resolve: P5 Resolve\nrebase origin/main in feature worktree\nconflict -> AI resolves in worktree\nthen force-push + mandatory CI revalidation
    P5_Resolve --> P5c_Gate: rebase clean (direct or AI-resolved) + CI green
    P5_Resolve --> CONFLICT: AI could not resolve -> abort + comment
    P5_Resolve --> CONFLICT: CI not green after rebase
    P5_Resolve --> NOT_MERGEABLE: no worktree / fetch failed / blocked

    P5b_FixCI: P5b FixCI\nAI repairs red CI in feature worktree\nthen force-push + mandatory CI revalidation
    P5b_FixCI --> P5c_Gate: fixed + CI green
    P5b_FixCI --> CI_HELD: no fix / CI still red / cap reached

    P5c_Gate: P5c Merge gates, in order: review (heavy-run issue only, no switch), security (PR_WATCH_ENABLE_SECURITY_GATE), semantic (PR_WATCH_ENABLE_SEMANTIC_CHECK)\nsemantic trigger first, no agent: 1 REST listing of merged auto-run/ siblings since run start, dir overlap?\nagent reviews the final diff base...head, result per head SHA (semantic: head + base SHA)\nholding finding -> AI fix in worktree + CI revalidation + re-review\n(fix-attempt cap; a reviewed head is never reviewed again; a head move re-runs every gate)
    P5c_Gate --> P6_Merge: clean / below threshold / semantic not triggered (gate OFF: pass-through)
    P5c_Gate --> GATE_HELD: fix failed / cap spent / review did not run
    P5c_Gate --> NOT_MERGEABLE: no run-dir / worktree, fetch failed, head mismatch, sibling listing failed

    P6_Merge: P6 Merge\ngh pr merge --rebase [--match-head-commit] (no --delete-branch: the worktree holds it until P9)\nrebase rejected (merge commit on branch) -> retry --merge\nremote branch deleted separately after the merge
    P6_Merge --> P7_PostMerge: merged
    P6_Merge --> MERGE_FAIL: merge failed

    P7_PostMerge: P7 PostMerge\noptional .claude/post-merge-migrate.sh\n(on main; POST_COMMIT_SYNC NOT set)
    P7_PostMerge --> P8_Finalize: ok / no script
    P7_PostMerge --> MIGRATE_FAIL: script exit != 0

    P8_Finalize: P8 Finalize\nstate_finalize merged + pr_merged event\n(BEFORE cleanup — invariant I4)
    P8_Finalize --> P8b_CloseIssue

    P8b_CloseIssue: P8b CloseLinkedIssue\nshould_close_linked_issue(baseRef, defaultBranch)\nexplicit gh issue close iff base != default\n(remote op — BEFORE host gate; best-effort)
    P8b_CloseIssue --> P9_Cleanup

    P9_Cleanup: P9 Cleanup\nhost gate: local cleanup only if\nrun.json.host == hostname -s\nelse print ssh hint
    P9_Cleanup --> DONE

    DONE: exit 0
    SCAN_EMPTY: exit 2
    LOCK_RACE: exit 3
    NOT_MERGEABLE: exit 4 (retry next poll)
    MERGE_FAIL: exit 5
    CONFLICT: exit 6 (human needed)
    MIGRATE_FAIL: exit 7
    CI_HELD: exit 8 (needs-human)
    GATE_HELD: exit 10 (needs-human, findings commented)

    DONE --> [*]
    SCAN_EMPTY --> [*]
    LOCK_RACE --> [*]
    NOT_MERGEABLE --> [*]
    MERGE_FAIL --> [*]
    CONFLICT --> [*]
    MIGRATE_FAIL --> [*]
    CI_HELD --> [*]
    GATE_HELD --> [*]
